        "original_id": "f61c8710-791a-5fc7-947d-6f1ff225a6a8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: TV (software), Apple TV\n- Companies: Apple Inc.\n- Concepts: media players, digital streaming, iTunes Store, iOS apps, microconsoles\n\nFacts:\n- On earlier versions of iOS, the Videos application handled playback of purchased television shows and films.\n- TV is software that serves as a media player for television shows and films purchased in the iTunes Store.\n- TV replaced the Videos application on iOS.\n- Apple TV is a digital media player and microconsole developed and sold by Apple Inc.\n- Apple TV is a small network appliance and entertainment device.\n- Apple TV can receive digital data from multiple sources and stream it to a compatible television.",
